<title>UK: BT to spend 100 mln stg on Scottish property.</title>
<headline>BT to spend 100 mln stg on Scottish property.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Telecommunications Plc said on Monday that it planned to spend 100 million stg on two offices in Scotland and on property upgrades in other part of the country.  </p>
<p>It plans to invest 50 million stg in a building for 1400 workers in Glasgow and 35 million stg on an office for 900 workers in Edinburgh. BT will also spend 15 million refurbishing existing buildings in Scotland.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
